            <div xml:id="d70">

                <pb facs="0224" n="139" xml:id="pg139"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2162: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-30T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                                1919, 6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your October 29, 6 p.m.</p>
                <p>Carvajal does not intend to go to Santo Domingo at this time and has returned to
                    Cuba.</p>
                <p>Mail Department full details as to powers, etc., of proposed advisory board.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
